#### Segment 2: Paragraph 2 (Theoretical Extension and Experimental Results)
**Text**: *"The proof extends Theorem 1 to handle dynamic data streams, ensuring the algorithm maintains consistency under non-stationary conditions. Crucially, empirical tests on 100+ real-world datasets demonstrate that the output of the algorithm consistently satisfies the maximum rank constraint (≤ 0.95) with 95% confidence."*

